id: divine-spell
name: Divine Spell
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCostPerBaseTier: 2
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
# A Domain Maneuver (God of a Domain (3)), a God Maneuver: open while the Domain in brackets is yours, only in God Ki, paid in Divine Ki Points.
godManeuver: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Arcane secrets unfold before you as you cast a spell backed by divine power.
text: >
  Divine Spell [1/Round]: Arcane secrets unfold before you as you cast a spell backed by divine power.
  –Maneuver Type: Instant
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –Minions: N/A
  –DKP Cost: 2(bT)
  –Effect: Use a Unique Ability that is a Standard Maneuver with an Action Cost of 1 Action as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

[on used]
domainOutOfSequence(unique);
